We will show you how to transplant your seedlings started in the nursery so you can set them out on your permanent growing beds.

Transplanting is done in **6 steps** (about 2 hours by hand for a 10 m × 75 cm bed).

Respecting the right spacing allows you to:
- Optimize density and plan the number of plants per bed;
- Make maintenance and harvesting easier;
- Assess the profitability of the bed.
